ckgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ord_auth" target="ord_exp"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="1" exitY="0.8" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.85" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" x="0" y="-12"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2611" y="484" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="t_o4" value="&lt;b&gt;flight_completed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Kit reports status on MQTT or first object arrives (ASM-143)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Drone Kit / Reception Lambda&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#c2410c;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#c2410c;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ord_disp" target="ord_flown"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0.5" exitY="1" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.5" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t_o5" value="&lt;b&gt;Flight record persisted&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Record matches package digest, pilot &amp; kit active (ASM-146)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Reception Lambda&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#16a34a;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ord_flown" target="ord_exec"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0.5" exitY="1" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.5" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t_o5b" value="&lt;b&gt;Direct upload&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Persisted without prior flown status&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Reception Lambda&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#16a34a;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ord_disp" target="ord_exec"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0" exitY="0.7" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0" entryY="0.3" entryPerimeter="1" x="0" y="0"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1545" y="658" /><mxPoint x="1545" y="1058" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="t_o7_disp" value="&lt;b&gt;window_elapsed (dispatched)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; window_end passes with no record, NOT in flown (ASM-029)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Platform Scheduler&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#dc2626;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#dc2626;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ord_disp" target="ord_exp"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="1" exitY="0.3" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0" entryY="0.35" entryPerimeter="1" x="0" y="-12"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2100" y="636" /><mxPoint x="2100" y="582" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="t_o9_kit" value="&lt;b&gt;kit_revoked&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Kit revoked &amp; window_end passes (A09 sec 10)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Platform Scheduler&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#dc2626;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#dc2626;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ord_disp" target="ord_exp"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="1" exitY="0.7" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0" entryY="0.75" entryPerimeter="1" x="0" y="12"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2100" y="658" /><mxPoint x="2100" y="642" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="t_o6" value="&lt;b&gt;Verification result&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Verification mission record &amp; objects persisted (ASM-141)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Verification Lambda / Platform&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#15803d;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ord_exec" target="ord_closed"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0.5" exitY="1" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.5" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t_o10" value="&lt;b&gt;Late record arrives&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Flown within window, pilot/kit active at takeoff; flagged late_record (ASM-142)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Reception Lambda&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#059669;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ord_exp" target="ord_exec"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0.5" exitY="1" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="1" entryY="0.5" entryPerimeter="1" x="0" y="0"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2475" y="1070" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="order_note_box" value="&lt;b&gt;FUMIGATION ORDER INVARIANTS (Section 5.2 / ADR-002):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Human Authorization Mandatory:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;'La autorización de fumigación es una identidad humana. Ningún disparador la ejecuta.'&lt;/i&gt; Function roles strictly denied.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;No-Signal Store-and-Forward:&lt;/b&gt; An order in &lt;code&gt;flown&lt;/code&gt; does &lt;b&gt;NOT&lt;/b&gt; expire at &lt;code&gt;window_end&lt;/code&gt;: the flight occurred in window and sits in local buffer (PD-141).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Executed State Flags:&lt;/b&gt; Order reaches &lt;code&gt;executed&lt;/code&gt; on ANY persisted fumigation flight record. Flagged (not blocked) if: &lt;code&gt;aborted_closure&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;out_of_window&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;batch_mismatch&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;late_record&lt;/code&gt; (ASM-146).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Order Closure:&lt;/b&gt; Moves to &lt;code&gt;closed&lt;/code&gt; on ANY persisted verification result (both &lt;code&gt;can_close&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;cannot_close&lt;/code&gt; close the order, ASM-141)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#eab308;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1430" y="1390" width="1260" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="mission_start" value="" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3147" y="195" width="26" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="mis_plan" value="&lt;b&gt;planned&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#475569;'&gt;Planned in campaign or case&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3040" y="260" width="240" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="mis_assign" value="&lt;b&gt;assigned&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#475569;'&gt;Pilot assigned with valid permit&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e0f2fe;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3040" y="440" width="240" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="mis_disp" value="&lt;b&gt;dispatched&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#475569;'&gt;Mission package downloaded&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fed7aa;strokeColor=#ea580c;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3040" y="620" width="240" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="mis_flown" value="&lt;b&gt;flown&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#475569;'&gt;Flight complete / 1st object uploaded&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fed7aa;strokeColor=#c2410c;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3040" y="820" width="240" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="mis_persisted" value="&lt;b&gt;record_persisted&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#475569;'&gt;TERMINAL SUCCESS | Record &amp; manifest persisted in S3 / DDB&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;double=1;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3040" y="1040" width="280" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="mis_cancel" value="&lt;b&gt;cancelled&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b91c1c' style='font-size:11px;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;TERMINAL STATE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px;color:#475569;'&gt;Triggers: Case closed | order expired | campaign ended | pilot/kit revoked&lt;br/&gt;Evidence preserved if record arrives later (ASM-143)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fee2e2;strokeColor=#dc2626;strokeWidth=2;double=1;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3640" y="530" width="390" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t_m0" value="&lt;b&gt;Mission planned&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Farm enrolled; case/campaign in planning state&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Platform / Agronomist&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#059669;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mission_start" target="mis_plan"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0.5" exitY="1" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.5" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t_m1" value="&lt;b&gt;Pilot assigned&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Pilot in drone_operator, permit valid &gt; window (ASM-148)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Agronomist (fumigation: at auth)&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#0284c7;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mis_plan" target="mis_assign"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0.5" exitY="1" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.5" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t_m2" value="&lt;b&gt;Package download&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Operator MFA, permit valid, kit ACTIVE; order authorized&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Drone Operator&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#ea580c;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#ea580c;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mis_assign" target="mis_disp"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0.5" exitY="1" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.5" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t_m3" value="&lt;b&gt;flight_completed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Kit reports status message with package digest (ASM-143)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Drone Kit / Reception Lambda&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#c2410c;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#c2410c;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mis_disp" target="mis_flown"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0.5" exitY="1" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.5" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t_m4" value="&lt;b&gt;Manifest &amp; record match&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Record and all manifest objects persisted with matching checksums (ASM-146)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Reception Lambda&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#15803d;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mis_flown" target="mis_persisted"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0.5" exitY="1" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.5" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t_m4b" value="&lt;b&gt;Direct persistence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Persisted without prior flown status&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Reception Lambda&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#15803d;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mis_disp" target="mis_persisted"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="0" exitY="0.7" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0" entryY="0.3" entryPerimeter="1" x="0" y="0"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2905" y="658" /><mxPoint x="2905" y="1058" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="t_m6_plan" value="&lt;b&gt;Planned cancelled&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Planned mission superseded or campaign ended without flight&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Platform or Agronomist&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#dc2626;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#dc2626;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mis_plan" target="mis_cancel"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="1" exitY="0.5" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.5" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" x="0" y="-12"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="3835" y="287" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="t_m7_assign" value="&lt;b&gt;Assigned cancelled&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Assigned pilot revoked before download or order expired&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Platform or Agronomist&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#dc2626;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#dc2626;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mis_assign" target="mis_cancel"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="1" exitY="0.5" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0.25" entryY="0" entryPerimeter="1" x="0" y="-12"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="3737" y="467" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="t_m5_disp" value="&lt;b&gt;Dispatched cancelled&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#1e40af'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Guard]:&lt;/b&gt; Case closed, order expired, or pilot/kit revoked before flight&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#b45309'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Actor]:&lt;/b&gt; Platform or Agronomist&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#dc2626;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontColor=#dc2626;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mis_disp" target="mis_cancel"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" exitX="1" exitY="0.5" exitPerimeter="1" entryX="0" entryY="0.5" entryPerimeter="1" x="0" y="-12" /></mxCell><mxCell id="mission_note_box" value="&lt;b&gt;MISSION INVARIANTS (Section 5.3 / A15 / A17):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Five Mandatory Services:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;'Los cinco entran. No se sustituye uno por otro.'&lt;/i&gt; Types: &lt;code&gt;delimitation&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;confirmation&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;fumigation&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;verification&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;estimation&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Upload Quarantine:&lt;/b&gt; Objects failing grant/checksum checks go to &lt;code&gt;quarantine/{yyyy}/{mm}/{dd}/&lt;/code&gt; and do &lt;b&gt;NOT&lt;/b&gt; count toward persistence (PD-104).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Inference Decoupling:&lt;/b&gt; Drone inference functions trigger on &lt;code&gt;mission_record_persisted&lt;/code&gt; via DynamoDB Streams -&gt; EventBridge, &lt;b&gt;NEVER&lt;/b&gt; on raw S3 object arrival (ASM-149).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Flight Without Persisted Record:&lt;/b&gt; A mission in &lt;code&gt;dispatched&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;flown&lt;/code&gt; without a persisted record is flagged as unpersisted flight (Point 6 / A21)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#10b981;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#064e3b;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2790" y="1390" width="1260" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="panel_bottom_roles" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="1680" width="4020" height="280" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="panel_bottom_hdr" value="CROSS-CUTTING GOVERNANCE, ACTOR ROLES &amp; LIFECYCLE INVARIANTS (docs/drone-service.md, ADR-002, A09, A15, A17)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e293b;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1690" width="4000" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pnl_col_70" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Agronomist Role (SR2/JR2 | Cognito staff MFA):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Only authorized identity for fumigation orders.&lt;br/&gt;• Must have fresh MFA session (auth_time &lt;= 10 min, ASM-092).&lt;br/&gt;• Authorizer ID captured from token; cannot be operator.&lt;br/&gt;• Re-checks cases: closes without fumigation or requests new confirmation / verification.&lt;br/&gt;• Sets window (window_start, window_end) and product batch." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1735" width="960" height="210" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pnl_col_1070" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Contracted Pilot &amp; Drone Kit (A09 sec 6):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Pilot in Cognito staff with MFA; Aerocivil permit verified (ASM-020).&lt;br/&gt;• Drone Kit registered as AWS IoT Thing with X.509 certificate.&lt;br/&gt;• Upload Grant: IoT MQTT grant limits uploads to exact S3 keys.&lt;br/&gt;• Preload: Mission package downloaded before takeoff.&lt;br/&gt;• Non-volatile encrypted buffer: Survives zero-signal flights.&lt;br/&gt;• Buffer eviction: Strictly conditional on persistence receipt." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="1735" width="960" height="210" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pnl_col_2070" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Event-Driven Inference (Part E / A17 / D10):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Confirmation, Verification, Estimation call Amazon Bedrock.&lt;br/&gt;• Model: Nova Pro in us-east-1 on-demand, zero-shot (ASM-160).&lt;br/&gt;• Trigger: DynamoDB Stream pipe to EventBridge (ASM-149).&lt;br/&gt;• Bedrock output: Confidence in [0, 1] + pest_signs.&lt;br/&gt;• Persistence: DynamoDB TransactWriteItems appends result.&lt;br/&gt;• Failure safety: If call fails, state stays unchanged (Part E)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2070" y="1735" width="960" height="210" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pnl_col_3070" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Case, Order &amp; S3 Traceability (ASM-145, ASM-146):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Storage: DynamoDB records table under KMS key 'records'.&lt;br/&gt;• Retention: 5-year compliance lifecycle for all records &amp; S3 objects.&lt;br/&gt;• Flight Record: Mandatory flight closure ('completed' / 'aborted').&lt;br/&gt;• Observability: A21 monitors unclosed fumigations, unflown orders,&lt;br/&gt;  and missions in dispatched/flown without persisted records.&lt;br/&gt;• S3 Block Public Access; opaque identifiers only (no PII, ASM-145)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3070" y="1735" width="960" height="210" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>